I come back to the room.
There is a small bathroom here.
I go to the bathroom.
I wash my face.
The water is cold.
Now I go to the bed.
There is a fan above.
There is the sound of the fan.
Outside, there is also the sound of the city.
The city of Mumbai is very huge.
Am I nervous?
Yes, I am a little nervous.
But I am also very excited.
This is my new life in India.
Today is my first night here.
Everything is fine.
I close my eyes.
I go to sleep.
